WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.260 --> 00:00:04.150
Another thing Dr. Bright is not allowed to
do at the Foundation: Dr. Bright!

00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:05.780
No staring contests with SCP-096!

00:00:05.780 --> 00:00:13.809
SCP-096 is a highly dangerous anomaly, but
it is also a relatively simple one.

00:00:13.809 --> 00:00:17.180
It wants one thing: For no one to look at
its face.

00:00:17.180 --> 00:00:18.180
Ever.

00:00:18.180 --> 00:00:24.580
So there is no reason, ever, for Dr. Bright
to try to engage in a "staring contest" with

00:00:24.580 --> 00:00:25.580
SCP-096.

00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:28.910
Nor is it ever acceptable for Dr. Bright to
try and convince anyone to have a "friendly

00:00:28.910 --> 00:00:31.039
staring contest" with the entity.

00:00:31.039 --> 00:00:32.390
It will not be friendly.

00:00:32.390 --> 00:00:33.590
It will be deadly.

00:00:33.590 --> 00:00:36.290
Don't try to bribe them into doing it, either.

